  "title": "Introducing Developer and Customer Management Roles",
  "summary": "We've added two new roles to the PropelAuth dashboard: Developer and Customer Management. The idea behind both is the same: give people access to everything they need for their job, without access to anything extra. In practice, the person setting up your login methods and the person helping a customer fix their SSO connection are doing pretty different things. Before today, you'd have had to give both of them broader access than either actually needed. These roles fix that. Developer The De",
